# What `docker build` doesn't send to Docker: only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md
# and koopjeskompas/ are used. Leaving the rest out keeps builds fast and keeps local
# files (deals, credentials, a virtualenv for another OS) out of the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!koopjeskompas/
**/__pycache__
